            "prompt": "Create a COMPLETE OPAQUE full-background portrait4:5 painting, target1280x1600. Every pixel of the image fully opaque and naturally painted, including all corners. No alpha transparency anywhere. This is a finished scene, NOT a cutout or atlas. Dimensional warm storybook digital illustration, soft visible paint texture, exquisite natural details, gentle upper-left sunshine. No text, labels, logos, landmarks, people, frame, UI or watermark. A sunny communal courtyard with beautiful patterned floor tiles, wideintimate view slightly above. Softviolet plasterwalls and lavender-patternedtiles dominatepalette, creamstoneedges and roseceramicpots. Genericlowcottagearchitecture. Openwindowupperleftwithbarecurtainrail andnocurtain. Barelineacrossupperquarter, emptysectionx30%,y20% forlaterpennant. Flowerboxrightmiddlex81%,y43% with lowfoliage androomfortallflowers. Claypotleftforegroundx15%,y82% withbarewoodytwig. Clearopaque palesky above roof. Omitfive laterdetails: ivorypennant, floweringwindowboxsprig, ivorywindowcurtain, foregroundpotsprig andpaleskycloud. Paintattractivecomplete courtyard with no holes andfullyopaqueallcorners.",
